Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The ferry leaves at nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought them\Nthis morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we still have time\Nfor a coffee at the harbour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The small place\Nnext to the fish market?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.25,0:00:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They open early\Non Saturdays.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
